/// Each method misuses a sibling file's declaration. Every finding is a
/// live-recheck failure, so it fails `--warnings-as-errors`, and each needs
/// cross-file context the lint surfaces must share to be reported at all.
Object subclass: Caller

  /// A selector no class or extension defines: does-not-understand.
  unknownSelector => Greeter new frobnicate

  /// `42` does not conform to the sibling file's `Greetable` protocol.
  nonConforming -> String => Greeter new welcome: 42

  /// `#medium` is not a member of the sibling file's `Level` alias.
  outOfRange -> Level => #medium
